  "description": "The trashcan that is kept: deprecated and throwaway structured content, addressable and exported and deliberately absent from the rendered site. Reachable BY NAME only — every other published graph has its references stripped, so nothing links here. Activity logs live under this tree and are excluded: a file is included only if it declares itself folio-fsh-guts/v1.",
